{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the darkness and experience first-person horror in The Necronomicon. After a devastating loss, you enter a cursed cemetery, determined to find the legendary Book of the Dead and perform a forbidden ritual to reunite with your deceased daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you are not alone. Dimensions collide in this sacred ground, and terrifying supernatural creatures have been tasked with protecting its secrets. They relentlessly pursue you through the tombs and mausoleums.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive and achieve your goal, you must:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate every corner of the cemetery, collecting common items and crucial magical artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to unlock doors and access new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the terror that lurks within its shadows, using magical weapons to defend yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery behind the ritual before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey of despair and hope awaits. Is your courage enough to face what emerges from the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070930/extras/1848bc36ac280ee88db8eeb2a04a38aa.poster.avif?t=1762345985\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070930/extras/1848bc36ac280ee88db8eeb2a04a38aa.webm?t=1762345985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070930/extras/1848bc36ac280ee88db8eeb2a04a38aa.mp4?t=1762345985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070930/extras/b8ffc743101cd935803c11edf3ccd1c8.poster.avif?t=1762345985\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070930/extras/b8ffc743101cd935803c11edf3ccd1c8.webm?t=1762345985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070930/extras/dfaf8a2b13b39ae38e972c738262223b.poster.avif?t=1762345985\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070930/extras/dfaf8a2b13b39ae38e972c738262223b.webm?t=1762345985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070930/extras/dfaf8a2b13b39ae38e972c738262223b.mp4?t=1762345985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4070930?t=1762345985","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070930/cbd200b33e3b4f35bb129736a3b195d3396f6e72/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762345985","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070930/4c00bb3e371e7b08438e16aa8dd11c58749b89fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762345985","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070930/4c00bb3e371e7b08438e16aa8dd11c58749b89fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762345985","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description"